    "faq": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question-0": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I place an order?",
            "text": "<p>1. Visit <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/\">www.drinkdrystore.com</a> and register your contact details to create an account. </p><p>2. Browse by Brand, Occasion, or Category and select the product(s) you want to buy by clicking <strong>“Add to Cart\". </strong></p><p>3. A pop up will appear where you can choose the pack size, add other products or remove selected products from your cart.</p><p>4. Once you are happy with your selection, click \"Checkout\" and follow the steps on the screen.</p><p>5. Once your order is placed, you will receive an email confirming your order number and product details. Please check your contact details are filled in correctly and get in touch with sales@drinkdrystore.com if you need to make any changes.</p>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why have I not received confirmation of my order, but my payment has been taken? ",
            "text": "<p>We apologise for the inconvenience and our team is always ready to help you track your order. Please reach out to us through one of our customer support channels and ensure you have your order number at hand so our team can best support you: </p><ul><li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry\">https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry</a></li><li><strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore/\">instagram.com/drinkdrystore/</a></li><li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/#SALES@DRINKDRYSTORE.COM\">sales@drinkdrystore.com</a></li><li><strong>Whatsapp</strong>: +971 50 705 5461  </li></ul>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my order is missing?",
            "text": "<p>If you have not received your order in 2-3 days from when you placed it, please reach out to us through one of our customer support channels. Our team will be happy to support you. Please ensure you have your order number at hand: </p><ul><li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry\">https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry</a></li><li><strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore/\">https://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore</a></li><li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/#SALES@DRINKDRYSTORE.COM\">sales@drinkdrystore.com</a></li><li><strong>Whatsapp</strong>: +971 50 705 5461 </li></ul>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my order is incomplete? ",
            "text": "<p>Please note that we only charge you for items that we deliver to you. We apologise for any inconvenience caused by incomplete orders.</p><p>Kindly reach out to us through one of our customer support channels, and we will look into this matter and resolve it as soon as possible. Please ensure you have your order number at hand: </p><ul><li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry\">https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry</a></li><li><strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore/\">instagram.com/drinkdrystore/</a></li><li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/#SALES@DRINKDRYSTORE.COM\">sales@drinkdrystore.com</a></li><li><strong>Whatsapp</strong>: +971 50 705 5461  </li></ul>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if my order has damaged items on arrival?",
            "text": "<p>Here at Drink Dry, our team takes special care of each order to ensure it reaches you in perfect condition. On the odd occasion that you do receive a damaged item, please reach out to us through one of our customer support channels, and our team will be happy to support you. Please ensure you have your order number at hand: </p><ul><li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry\">https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry</a></li><li><strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore/\">instagram.com/drinkdrystore/</a></li><li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/#SALES@DRINKDRYSTORE.COM\">sales@drinkdrystore.com</a></li><li><strong>Whatsapp</strong>: +971 50 705 5461  </li></ul>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "If I change my mind, how can I change/cancel my order?",
            "text": "<p>We are sorry to hear that you want to cancel your order. The quickest way to do that is to contact our customer support team via one of the below channels: </p><ul><li><strong>Facebook</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry\">https://www.facebook.com/drinkdry</a></li><li><strong>Instagram</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.instagram.com/drinkdrystore/\">instagram.com/drinkdrystore/</a></li><li><strong>Email</strong>: <a href=\"https://drinkdrystore.com/#SALES@DRINKDRYSTORE.COM\">sales@drinkdrystore.com</a></li><li><strong>Whatsapp</strong>: +971 50 705 5461 </li></ul><p>If you have made the purchase online with a credit card, payment will be reversed in 3-5 business days.  </p>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        },
        "question_bNA67E": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will out of stock products be restocked?",
            "text": "<p>We’re sorry if the item you want is out of stock. There are times when we will continue to show products that are out of stock so that you have access to the product details or to enable you to buy at a later date. We try our best to re-stock the product at our earliest. This might take a few days as most of our products are imported from the UK, Belgium, Spain and other countries. </p>",
            "enable_highlight": false,
            "highlight_style": "marker"
          }
        }
      },
