          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I pay?",
            "text": "<p>When shopping at <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">drinkdrystore.com</span>, you can be assured of an easy-to-navigate and secure site that provides easy and secure payment solutions to cater for all your needs. You can pay by card or cash on delivery. We accept Visa, Mastercard, and JCB.</p>",
